WEBVTT

00:16:29.503 --> 00:16:33.862
veteperceptimin tone ne nje vend te ri.

00:16:34.369 --> 00:16:40.099
(Muzike)

00:16:40.099 --> 00:16:44.772
♫ Ketu eshte Major Tom 
ne kullen e kontrollit ♫

00:16:44.772 --> 00:16:49.831
♫ jam larguar pergjithmone ♫

00:16:49.831 --> 00:16:56.638
♫ dhe po fluturoj ne nje nga menyrat 
me te vecanta ♫

00:16:56.638 --> 00:17:03.743
♫ dhe yjet duken shume ndryshe sot ♫